---
// The stage: soft cotton-candy clouds drifting behind the glass. Decorative only.
// Each puff is a few overlapping radial gradients (no live blur), and only transforms
// animate, so it stays cheap on phones. Still for prefers-reduced-motion.
---
<div class="stage" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="puff puff-1"></span>
  <span class="puff puff-2"></span>
  <span class="puff puff-3"></span>
  <span class="puff puff-4"></span>
  <span class="puff puff-5"></span>
  <span class="puff puff-6"></span>
  <span class="grain"></span>
</div>
